[PrintTextModified Text:真的吗……？那我们走吧。|#0101Bad06_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露和艾玛手牵手离开了。|#0101Bad06_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过艾玛还是有些在意诺亚的情况，<br>扭头往她的房间看了一眼。|#0101Bad06_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（诺亚她今天也不去用餐吗）|#0101Bad06_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也许她还在专心搞艺术吧。|#0101Bad06_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（可是，有点奇怪。<br>　平常的话，应该能听到她的喷罐声音才对……）|#0101Bad06_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

