[PrintTextModified Text:走进食堂的艾玛一想到那些黏糊糊的<br>诡异饭菜，便叹了口气。|#0101Bad06_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

