@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR5

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，艾玛！<br>你终于来了！|#0101Bad06_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉挥手向艾玛招呼。<br>其他的少女今天也难得地都坐在了一起。<br>所有人都已经开始用餐了。|#0101Bad06_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR13

