@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:自从来到这里，她们身边常常充满着杀气和紧张的气氛。<br>不过今晚，少女之间的气氛却是十分和睦。|#0101Bad06_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（要是之后可以一直不发生互相厮杀，<br>　所有人能一起离开这里就更好了）|#0101Bad06_Ema013|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……啊，诺亚……|#0101Bad06_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:忽然间，她想起现在这里缺了一个人。|#0101Bad06_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这么好吃的饭菜，没吃到真是太可惜了。<br>　之后给诺亚也带一些饭菜过去吧）|#0101Bad06_Ema015|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile1,ArmR1

