[PrintTextModified Text:晚餐后，<br>艾玛去给诺亚送饭了。|#0101Bad06_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚，我给你带今天的晚餐了……哎呀？|#0101Bad06_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:涂满喷漆画的房内，<br>不见诺亚的影子。|#0101Bad06_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只见她用过的喷罐<br>孤零零地躺在地上。|#0101Bad06_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:（真奇怪……她跑哪里去了？）|#0101Bad06_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:晚餐后是一段较长的放风时间，<br>或许她是跑到别的地方打发时间了。|#0101Bad06_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如果是这样的话，那她晚点就回来了吧。<br>　希望她能喜欢我给她带的饭）|#0101Bad06_Ema019|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:可是，不管过了多久，<br>城崎诺亚都没有再回来过了。|#0101Bad06_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然四处找过她，但都没找着。<br>时间就这样一天天地流逝。|#0101Bad06_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:之后，监牢内<br>定期会有【美味大餐】供应，但——|#0101Bad06_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:每次出餐，都会有一位少女不知所踪。|#0101Bad06_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

